  "name": "Question 14",
  "problem": "The constant term in the expression $4m+7n$ is{{field-1}}.",
  "worked_solution": "The expression has two terms: \n\n$$\n4m\\,,\\,7n\n$$\n\n \n\nEach of these terms contains a variable, so none are constant.\n\nThe constant term is missing. However, we can include it by adding zero to the expression. Rewriting the given expression as\n\n$$\n4m+7n+0,\n$$\n\nwe see that the constant term is $0.$",
